<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n102226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾰλαντ-εύω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάλαντον</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>balance,
				sway to and fro</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τι ἐν
				ὀφθαλμοῖς</span>
			<i>let</i> it <i>hover</i> before them, <i><span class="en">
				Hld.
				8.17
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τ. τὰ καθ᾽ ἡμᾶς ἡ μοῖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					10.9
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>sway backwards and forwards, ebb and flow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τὸ ταλαντεύεσθαι [τὴν θάλατταν]
					δεῦρο κἀκεῖσε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					354a8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς μάχης δεῦρο κἀκεῖσε ταλαντευομένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				16.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέπει καὶ τ. πρὸς τοὐναντίον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.682e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>weigh out, measure out</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδασι</span> (i.e. by the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κλεψύδρα</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> ἠελίοιο ταλαντεύουσι κελεύθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.782
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Τιτὰν νύκτα ταλαντεύει καὶ φάος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>App.Anth.</u>
					4.74
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Synesius</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τούτων σὺ τὴν αἵρεσιν τ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Alciphr.
				1.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ζῆν οὐδ᾽ ὑπὸ τούτοις
				ταλαντεύεται</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<i>oscillate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπὶ θάτερα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>IA</u>
					708b14
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> intr.,
				<i>weigh down the balance</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ μὲν ἐταλάντευε τὸ ἔλεος, τῇ δ᾽
					ἀντέβριθεν ὁ νόμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					2.170
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
